  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Acces to education in El COCUY ( Colombia )</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project is about helping children from the El Carrizalito school attached to the main school of El Cocuy, Jose Santos Gutierrez.   One of the ain problems of this school is the need of new options to have a better development of education. Currently the school has a technology room which has 2 old computers.    In order to be able to help them with fiber optic internet and electronic devices. In this way improve education in places far from cities such as the Cocouy in Boyaca, Colombia.</narrative>
  </description>
